  "definition": "Waivers",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-08-28",
  "historyNote": "#9391, eff 2-21-09; amd by #9890-A, eff 3-22-11, (paras (a) & (d)-(l)); amd by #9890-B, eff 3-22-11, (paras (b) & (c)) ; ss by #12859, eff 8-28-19",
